# The subtr-actor static player/stats/review assets here are generated from the
# vendor/subtr-actor submodule (scripts/ensure-subtr-vendor populates them
# locally; the Nix server build points ROCKET_SENSE_SUBTR_STATIC at the
# js-stats-player-pages flake output). They are NOT committed — only the
# .subtr-actor-rev marker is, which pins the rev for the sync guard test.
*
!.subtr-actor-rev
